<title>UK: B.A.T seen down 20p after U.S. court ruling.</title>
<headline>B.A.T seen down 20p after U.S. court ruling.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>B.A.T Industries Plc was expected to open down 20 pence from Thursday's 554-1/2 close in pre-market trade on Friday after a U.S. court ruling rekindled worries over litigations against the tobacco indstry.</p>
<p>Imperial Tobacco Group Plc was also seen falling sharply, dealers said.</p>
</text>
